{"id":"n66416-2-8","stage":4,"title":"안성맞춤 · 正好","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66416-2-8-1","ko":"방이 조금 좁지 않아요?","zh":"这个房间不会有点窄吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방이","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방이","audio":"/audio/f8b8dcbdcf795ca5e772.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"좁지","meaning":"窄小","explanation":"좁다：窄小；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"1","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좁지","audio":"/audio/1e3711488e66bad2c42e.mp3"}},{"text":"않아요?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않아요","audio":"/audio/a3e2b4d007f43b3838eb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"窄小","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"面或底部等的面积小。","pronunciation":["좁따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a18bac7522573f916fff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66416-2-8-2","ko":"저처럼 혼자 사는 사람에게는 안성맞춤입니다.","zh":"对于像我这样独自居住的人来说，简直再合适不过了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저처럼","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저처럼","audio":"/audio/a6455107b976d03f27d9.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}},{"text":"사는","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사는","audio":"/audio/30f3407ddedb23e84811.mp3"}},{"text":"사람에게는","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람에게는","audio":"/audio/093c1b3ecde1d135e75a.mp3"}},{"text":"안성맞춤입니다.","meaning":"正好，合适","explanation":"안성맞춤：正好，合适；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"안성맞춤","audio":"/audio/7569af3dd4f58e8062a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66416","senseId":"2","lemma":"안성맞춤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안성맞춤입니다","audio":"/audio/d435f1be17e885ef36b9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/a